  "ingredients": [
    "0.5 cup butter, softened",
    "1 cup brown sugar",
    "1/2 cup white sugar",
    "2 eggs",
    "1 (8 ounce) can crushed pineapple, drained",
    "1 cup raisins",
    "0.75 cup shredded carrots",
    "2 cups all-purpose flour",
    "2 tablespoons ground cinnamon",
    "1 teaspoon baking powder",
    "0.5 teaspoon baking soda",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "1 cup chopped walnuts",
    "4 ounces cream cheese, softened",
    "1/4 cup butter, softened",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla",
    "2 1/2 to 3 cups powdered sugar"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "To make the cookies: Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease cookie sheets or line with parchment paper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lUfJ1KCiBygVMxbRVTJ2lC-ABHg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25803-carrot-cake-cookies-mfs-4x3-step-01-295baca97b354b3982429a689c8a8714.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25803/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat butter, brown sugar, and white sugar together in a large bowl with an electric mixer until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zeA0pzR_kWK9wjzLMZxmq2OO9Jo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25803-carrot-cake-cookies-mfs-4x3-step-03-8f929457b0504e26a98c8fef6d4a01ed.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25803/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat in eggs, one at a time, until combined. Stir in the crushed pineapple, carrots, and raisins.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Zo8r6lfLKrw33cwGVn6WQ-NadvU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25803-carrot-cake-cookies-mfs-4x3-step-05-e3fd783de73747e2a2cd72e7073bea7a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25803/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flour, baking powder, baking soda, salt and cinnamon; stir into carrot mixture. Fold in 3/4 cup walnuts if using.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/eJx8g7lfUXYy1Mtv_reI5BWdov8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25803-carrot-cake-cookies-mfs-4x3-step-06-2-b9f6b9eebc0b4e659c7f5cf85eb2b04f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25803/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drop spoonfuls of dough 2 inches apart onto the prepared cookie sheets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RANGYqm0gDzjVudiIyo9yV2LrNE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25803-carrot-cake-cookies-mfs-4x3-step-07-311408ddd7764423b3df792572ee5632.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25803/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until tops are set, about 14 to 16 minutes. Allow cookies to cool for 2 minutes on the cookie sheets before removing to wire racks to cool completely.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wNnsUAlHItjadY8ZXSFEFjZiOTs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25803-carrot-cake-cookies-mfs-4x3-step-08-5e3133bd67c6476a9dfb360440a60948.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25803/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make the cream cheese frosting: Beat cream cheese, butter, and vanilla with an electric mixer on medium speed in a large bowl until light and fluffy. Beat in powdered sugar gradually to reach spreading consistency.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/FgROwxnRZtrlWCJ0hHzdZL39u9s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25803-carrot-cake-cookies-mfs-4x3-step-09-2-c554968e8ba3420db37d3e1074b1bdf4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25803/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Frost cooled cookies with cream cheese frosting; sprinkle with remaining 1/4 cup walnuts, if desired.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/IaE9LQ-oQFetilBDOmsjnZX3J4U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25803-carrot-cake-cookies-mfs-4x3-step-10-5b8753cd7ed243a797433da412276ab7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25803/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
